       links and Book button) floats on its own frosted-glass surface instead of sharing one bar. On phones the
       whole header slides away while scrolling down and returns on scroll up. -->
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-7xl items-center justify-between gap-3">

    <a href="/" class="glass pointer-events-auto hidden h-14 items-center rounded-full px-6 lg:flex" aria-label={`${siteConfig.name} home`}>
      <img src="/images/crispr-logo.png" alt="CRISPR Skin and Hair Clinic" width="3240" height="1493" class="h-auto w-[150px] object-contain" />
    </a>

    <a href="/" class="glass pointer-events-auto flex h-12 min-w-0 items-center rounded-full px-4 lg:hidden" aria-label={`${siteConfig.name} home`}>
